---
---

<section id="register" class="py-20 bg-black relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-30">
        <div class="h-full w-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--accent)_0%,_transparent_35%)]"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-tighter">
                <span class="gradient-text">Regístrate Ahora</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="text-xl text-white/80 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                ¿Listo para sorprender al mundo con tu innovación? Asegura tu lugar en HACK//UTEC 2026 antes de que cierren las inscripciones.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10 p-12 mb-8">
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#0066ff]">Lo que necesitas para registrarte:</h3>
                    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-left max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#0066ff] flex-shrink-0">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                            </svg>
                            <span class="text-white/80">Equipo de 2 a 3 personas</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#0066ff] flex-shrink-0">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                            </svg>
                            <span class="text-white/80">Conocimientos de AWS; opcional GCP, Azure, OCI</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#0066ff] flex-shrink-0">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                            </svg>
                            <span class="text-white/80">Integración con APIs y servicios externos</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-[#0066ff] flex-shrink-0">
                                <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                            </svg>
                            <span class="text-white/80">Arquitectura preparada para datos en tiempo real</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <a
                            href="https://forms.gle/iNVUDnUgR1z1vBBb7"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="inline-block w-full max-w-md mx-auto py-4 px-8 bg-[#0066ff] text-white font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#0052cc] transition-all transform hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#0066ff]/25"
                    >
                        REGÍSTRATE EN HACK//UTEC
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="inline ml-2">
                            <path d="M7 17L17 7"></path>
                            <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </a>

                    <p class="text-sm text-white/60">
                        El registro toma aproximadamente de 3 a 5 minutos.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-8 p-4 border border-[#0066ff]/30 bg-[#0066ff]/10 rounded-none">
                <p class="text-sm text-white/80">
                    <strong>Fecha Límite:</strong> Jueves 18 de junio de 2026 a las 10:00 PM.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
